invariant: INV-14
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_chain_test
reason: webpki_read_entry accepts a non-empty per-entry extensions
  vector, so a CertificateEntry extension this client never offered — a
  status_request or signed_certificate_timestamp reply — is read past
  instead of refused with unsupported_extension, against RFC 9846 §4.3
  (docs/webpki.md, "Decisions"). The list framing test, which sets the
  vector on the leaf's entry and on a trailing one, objects.

--- old
    if (extensions_len != 0) {
        *alert = ALERT_UNSUPPORTED_EXTENSION;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    (void)extensions_len;
